<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Operator Greysia -->
  <OperatorGreysia.label>管制員格蕾西亞</OperatorGreysia.label>
  <!-- EN: Greysia is the switchboard operator, the clerk and the chief secretary of a Colonial Army office, and to her your colony looks like some sort of field unit, which makes it a good place to send things. She routes every contract, supply run and security alert onto your frequency. The Colonization Forces will always be on the line, and their enemies with them. -->
  <OperatorGreysia.description>格蕾西亞，殖民陸軍辦公室的接線員兼文書兼主任祕書，對她來說你的殖民地像是外勤單位之類的好地方。她把每一份委託、補給與警訊都轉到你的頻道上。殖民艦隊會一直在線，他們的敵人也一樣。</OperatorGreysia.description>

</LanguageData>
